msgstr "锁定"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:417
msgid "Connect the iPhone/iPad and the PC to the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr "将 iPhone/iPad 和 PC 连接到同一个 Wi-Fi。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:418
msgid "On the iPhone/iPad, open Control Center: swipe down from the top-right corner of the screen."
msgstr "在 iPhone/iPad 上打开控制中心：从屏幕右上角向下轻扫。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:419
msgid "Tap Screen Mirroring (the two stacked rectangles)."
msgstr "轻点“屏幕镜像”（两个重叠的矩形图标）。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:420
msgid "Pick ZenLinkStudio. The screen shows up here."
msgstr "选择 ZenLinkStudio，屏幕画面即会显示在此处。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:421
msgid "Press Start below."
msgstr "点击下方的“开始”。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:427
msgid "First time only: plug in the USB cable, then press Set up Wi-Fi in Settings › Connection & driver."
msgstr "仅首次需要：插入 USB 数据线，然后在“设置 › 连接与驱动”中点击“设置 Wi-Fi”。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:428
msgid "Unlock the iPhone/iPad, then press Start."
msgstr "解锁 iPhone/iPad，然后点击“开始”。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:429
msgid "Plug the iPhone/iPad into the PC with a USB cable."
msgstr "使用 USB 数据线将 iPhone/iPad 连接到 PC。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:430
msgid "Unlock its screen."
msgstr "解锁设备屏幕。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:431
msgid "If it asks \"Trust this computer?\", tap Trust and enter the passcode."
msgstr "如果提示“要信任此电脑吗？”，请轻点“信任”并输入密码。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:432
msgid "First time only: turn on Developer Mode in Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode, restart the device and tap Turn On. If the switch is missing, press Start once: ZenLink makes it appear."
msgstr "仅首次：在 设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式 中打开开发者模式，重启设备后点按“打开”。如果没有这个开关，先按一次“开始”，ZenLink 会让它出现。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:437
msgid "Needs Trust"
msgstr "需要信任"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:438
msgid "Wi-Fi not set up"
msgstr "尚未设置 Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:439
msgid "Choose a mode"
msgstr "选择模式"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:440
msgid "Needs Apple Devices"
msgstr "需要 Apple Devices"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:441
msgid "Needs a driver"
msgstr "需要驱动程序"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:442
msgid "Restore the Apple driver"
msgstr "恢复 Apple 驱动"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:443
msgid "Install the ZenLink Studio driver"
msgstr "安装 ZenLink Studio 驱动"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:444
msgid "libusb-win32 is not installed"
msgstr "未安装 libusb-win32"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:445
msgid "Remove the libusb0 filter first"
msgstr "请先移除 libusb0 过滤器"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:446
msgid "Choose a connection mode"
msgstr "选择连接模式"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:447
msgid "Wi-Fi is not set up yet"
msgstr "尚未设置 Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:448
msgid "Install Apple Devices"
msgstr "安装 Apple Devices"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:449
msgid "Unlock it and tap Trust"
msgstr "解锁设备并轻点“信任”"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:450
msgid "This device uses the ZenLink Studio driver, so Apple mode cannot see it. Restore the Apple driver, or switch to ZenLink Studio."
msgstr "此设备正在使用 ZenLink Studio 驱动，因此 Apple 模式无法识别它。请恢复 Apple 驱动，或切换至 ZenLink Studio。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:451
msgid "ZenLink Studio uses the libusb0 driver on the device. Install it, or switch to Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "ZenLink Studio 在设备上使用 libusb0 驱动。请安装该驱动，或切换至 Apple 驱动模式。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:452
msgid "Install the iOS driver of TikTok LIVE Studio or libusb-win32 once, then press Check drivers. Or use Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "请先安装 TikTok LIVE Studio 的 iOS 驱动或 libusb-win32，然后点击“检查驱动”。或者使用 Apple 驱动模式。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:453
msgid "A libusb0 filter is stacked on the Apple driver. It can crash Windows."
msgstr "Apple 驱动上叠加了 libusb0 过滤器，这可能会导致 Windows 崩溃。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:454
msgid "Pick Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio to continue."
msgstr "请选择“Apple 驱动”或“ZenLink Studio”以继续。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:455
msgid "Plug in the cable once, then press Set up Wi-Fi in Settings. Or choose Wired."
msgstr "请先插一次数据线，然后在“设置”中点击“设置 Wi-Fi”，或选择“有线连接”。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:456
msgid "Windows sees the device, but Apple Mobile Device Service is not running. Install Apple Devices from the Microsoft Store (or iTunes), then plug the cable in again. Or switch to ZenLink Studio."
msgstr "Windows 已识别设备，但 Apple Mobile Device Service 未运行。请从 Microsoft Store 安装 Apple Devices（或 iTunes），然后重新插入数据线。也可以切换到 ZenLink Studio。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:457
msgid "Unlock the device, tap Trust if it asks, then try again."
msgstr "请解锁设备，如出现提示请轻点“信任”，然后重试。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:459
msgid "Detect device"
msgstr "检测设备"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:459
msgid "Found on USB through the libusb0 driver"
msgstr "已通过 libusb0 驱动在 USB 上检测到设备"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:460
msgid "Open the device"
msgstr "打开设备"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:460
msgid "Switching it to its screen-capture mode"
msgstr "正在将其切换至屏幕采集模式"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:461
msgid "Check trust"
msgstr "检查信任状态"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:461
msgid "Keep it unlocked while ZenLink proves this PC is trusted"
msgstr "在 ZenLink 验证此 PC 的信任状态时，请保持设备处于解锁状态"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:462
msgid "Start stream"
msgstr "开始串流"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:462
msgid "Receiving the screen over ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "正在通过 ZenLink Studio 接收画面"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:464
msgid "Device connected"
msgstr "设备已连接"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:464
msgid "Your iPhone/iPad chose ZenLinkStudio in Screen Mirroring"
msgstr "您的 iPhone/iPad 已在“屏幕镜像”中选择 ZenLinkStudio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:465
msgid "Secure connection"
msgstr "安全连接"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:465
msgid "AirPlay pairing and FairPlay key exchange"
msgstr "AirPlay 配对与 FairPlay 密钥交换"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:466
msgid "Receive video"
msgstr "接收视频"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:466
msgid "Decrypting the AirPlay stream"
msgstr "正在解密 AirPlay 视频流"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:467
msgid "Receiving the screen over Wi-Fi"
msgstr "正在通过 Wi-Fi 接收画面"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:469
msgid "Found through Apple Mobile Device Service"
msgstr "已通过 Apple Mobile Device Service 发现设备"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:470
msgid "Opening an encrypted Wi-Fi tunnel to the device"
msgstr "正在建立通往设备的加密 Wi-Fi 通道"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:470
msgid "Opening an encrypted USB tunnel to the device"
msgstr "正在建立通往设备的加密 USB 通道"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:471
msgid "Prepare the device"
msgstr "准备设备"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:471
msgid "Keep it unlocked. The first time, a small developer image is installed."
msgstr "请保持设备解锁。首次连接时将安装一个小型开发者镜像。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:472
msgid "Receiving the screen in HEVC"
msgstr "正在接收 HEVC 编码画面"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:529
msgid "Ready · Wi-Fi"
msgstr "就绪 · Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:534
msgid "Waiting for the iPhone / iPad"
msgstr "正在等待 iPhone / iPad"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:535
msgid "Plug in an iPhone or iPad"
msgstr "请接入 iPhone 或 iPad"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:535
msgid "{device} ready"
msgstr "{device} 已就绪"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:544
msgid "Unlock it, then press Start mirroring."
msgstr "请解锁设备，然后点击“开始投屏”。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:567
msgid "Windows Firewall blocks ZenLink, so the iPhone/iPad cannot connect. Press the button below, then choose Yes."
msgstr "Windows 防火墙阻止了 ZenLink，导致 iPhone/iPad 无法连接。请点击下方按钮，然后选择“是”。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:574
msgid "Allow ZenLink on the network"
msgstr "允许 ZenLink 访问网络"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:646
msgid "Change"
msgstr "更改"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:647
msgid "Choose Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "选择 Apple 驱动或 ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:654
msgid "Wired (USB)"
msgstr "有线 (USB)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:661
msgid "Stop waiting"
msgstr "停止等待"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:669
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "重试"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:673
msgid "Restore Apple driver"
msgstr "恢复 Apple 驱动"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:674
msgid "Install driver"
msgstr "安装驱动"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:675
msgid "Remove filter"
msgstr "移除过滤器"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:676
msgid "Choose mode"
msgstr "选择模式"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:677
msgid "Get Apple Devices"
msgstr "获取 Apple Devices"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:678
msgid "Open settings"
msgstr "打开设置"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:701
msgid "Couldn't connect"
msgstr "无法连接"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:702
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "已连接"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:703
msgid "Connecting to {device}"
msgstr "正在连接到 {device}"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:704
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr "正在连接"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:739
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:901
msgid "Close ZenLink?"
msgstr "关闭 ZenLink？"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:904
msgid "ZenLink can keep running in the system tray so your devices stay connected."
msgstr "ZenLink 可以在系统托盘中继续运行，以便您的设备保持连接。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:914
msgid "Remember my choice"
msgstr "记住我的选择"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:933
msgid "You can change this in Settings."
msgstr "您可以随时在“设置”中更改此项。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:939
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:941
msgid "Quit ZenLink"
msgstr "退出 ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:942
msgid "Minimize to tray"
msgstr "最小化到托盘"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:992
msgid "How should ZenLink connect?"
msgstr "ZenLink 应如何连接？"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:993
msgid "Nothing connects and no driver changes until you continue."
msgstr "在您点击继续之前，不会进行任何连接或驱动更改。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1011
msgid "Standard · full control"
msgstr "标准 · 完整控制"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1012
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "推荐"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1013
msgid "Uses Apple's own driver. Most compatible, stable and easy."
msgstr "使用 Apple 官方驱动。兼容性最好，稳定且易用。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1015
msgid "Up to 60 fps, HEVC (device-limited bitrate, about 4–6 Mbps)"
msgstr "最高 60 fps，HEVC 编码（受设备限制的码率，约 4–6 Mbps）"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1016
msgid "Mouse touch, keyboard, gestures and buttons"
msgstr "支持鼠标触控、键盘、手势和按键"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1017
msgid "Apple's own driver, nothing to install"
msgstr "使用 Apple 官方驱动，无需额外安装"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1018
msgid "Wired or Wi-Fi (after a one-time setup with the cable)"
msgstr "支持有线或 Wi-Fi（需先通过数据线完成一次设置）"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1019
msgid "iOS 17–26: Hybrid Control (experimental)"
msgstr "iOS 17–26：混合控制（实验性）"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1020
msgid "iOS 16 or older: use ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "iOS 16 或更早版本：请使用 ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1029
msgid "For live streaming"
msgstr "适用于直播推流"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1030
msgid "Best quality for streaming: high bitrate (measured 12–30 Mbps), up to 60 fps, very low latency. Needs the libusb0 driver."
msgstr "直播推流最佳画质：高码率（实测 12–30 Mbps）、最高 60 fps、极低延迟。需要 libusb0 驱动。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1032
msgid "Up to 60 fps, full native resolution over the cable, high-bitrate H.264"
msgstr "最高 60 fps，有线连接支持完整原生分辨率，高码率 H.264"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1033
msgid "Wired (USB) or Wi-Fi (AirPlay, no driver)"
msgstr "有线 (USB) 或 Wi-Fi（AirPlay，无需驱动）"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1034
msgid "Picture and sound only: no touch, keyboard or gestures"
msgstr "仅传输画面和声音：不支持触控、键盘或手势"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1035
msgid "Apple apps can't see the device until you switch back"
msgstr "在切换回原驱动之前，Apple 应用将无法识别该设备"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1042
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接方式"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1046
msgid "Wired"
msgstr "有线"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1057
msgid "You can change it any time in Settings › Connection & driver. Changing it may need an app restart and reconnecting the cable."
msgstr "您可以随时在“设置 › 连接与驱动”中更改此项。更改后可能需要重启应用并重新插拔数据线。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1064
msgid "Change device type"
msgstr "更改设备类型"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1071
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1190
msgid "Detected"
msgstr "已检测到"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1191
msgid " detected"
msgstr " 已检测到"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1192
msgid "Mirror and control compatible Apple devices using USB or Wi-Fi."
msgstr "通过 USB 或 Wi-Fi 投屏并控制兼容的 Apple 设备。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1193
msgid "Android Smartphone / Tablet"
msgstr "Android 智能手机 / 平板电脑"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1194
msgid "High-performance Android mirroring and control over USB or Wi-Fi."
msgstr "通过 USB 或 Wi-Fi 实现高性能 Android 投屏与控制。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1196
msgid "Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "Apple 驱动或 ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1197
msgid "Wired or Wi-Fi"
msgstr "有线或 Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1200
msgid "Through ADB and scrcpy, no app on the phone"
msgstr "通过 ADB 和 scrcpy 实现，手机端无需安装任何应用"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1201
msgid "Wired or Wi-Fi, any Android brand"
msgstr "支持有线或 Wi-Fi，兼容任何 Android 品牌"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1236
msgid "Welcome to ZenLink"
msgstr "欢迎使用 ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1239
msgid "Which device would you like to connect?"
msgstr "您想要连接哪种设备？"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1308
msgid "Apple and Android devices are both connected. Choose the one to mirror."
msgstr "Apple 和 Android 设备均已连接。请选择要投屏的设备。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1315
msgid "Remember device type"
msgstr "记住设备类型"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1319
msgid "You can change it any time in Settings › Device type or with the Back button."
msgstr "您可以随时在“设置 › 设备类型”中更改，或点击“返回”按钮重新选择。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1432
msgid "Android video"
msgstr "Android 视频"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1436
msgid "A profile fills in resolution, FPS, bitrate and codec; change one value and the profile becomes Custom. Each phone keeps its own settings (the same over USB and Wi-Fi). Encoders are read from the phone on the first mirroring; if the chosen encoder fails, ZenLink tries another hardware encoder, then H.264, at most 4 times, and keeps your choice."
msgstr "预设配置文件会自动填充分辨率、帧率 (FPS)、码率和编码器；更改其中任一数值后，配置将变为“自定义”。每台手机会独立保存各自的设置（USB 与 Wi-Fi 共用）。首次投屏时会从手机读取编码器列表；如果所选编码器失败，ZenLink 会尝试其他硬件编码器，随后尝试 H.264，最多尝试 4 次，并保留您的原始选择。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1444
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "分辨率"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1444
msgid "Longest side."
msgstr "长边像素。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1451
msgid "A cap; the phone never goes above its refresh rate."
msgstr "帧率上限；实际帧率不会超过手机屏幕的刷新率。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1470
msgid "H.265 needs HEVC Video Extensions on Windows."
msgstr "H.265 需要在 Windows 上安装 HEVC 视频扩展。"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1471
