msgstr "当前 Windows（N 版或 KN 版）缺少系统视频组件，导致 ZenLink 无法显示画面。请添加免费的 Microsoft“媒体功能包”：打开“设置 › 应用 › 可选功能 › 查看功能 › 媒体功能包”，安装后重启 PC。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1233
msgid "Open Optional features"
msgstr "打开可选功能"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1253
msgid "Stop casting before changing drivers."
msgstr "请先停止投屏，再更改驱动程序。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1257
msgid "Connect the device first."
msgstr "请先连接设备。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1262
msgid "Restore the Apple driver?"
msgstr "确定恢复 Apple 驱动？"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1263
msgid "Apple Driver mode can see the device again. ZenLink Studio stops until its driver is installed again. A backup is saved first. Windows will ask for administrator permission. Unplug and reconnect the cable afterwards."
msgstr "恢复后 Apple 驱动模式将重新识别该设备，ZenLink Studio 将暂停使用直至重新安装其驱动。操作前会自动创建备份，Windows 随后会请求管理员权限。完成后请拔下并重新连接数据线。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1266
msgid "Install the ZenLink Studio driver?"
msgstr "确定安装 ZenLink Studio 驱动？"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1267
msgid "Like TikTok LIVE Studio, ZenLink installs the libusb-win32 driver for this device. While it is installed, Apple mode and Apple apps can't see the device; press Restore Apple driver to switch back. If there is no driver package for this model yet, ZenLink builds one and signs it with a new certificate named \"ZenLink ZenLink Studio\", added to Windows' trusted certificates (its private key is deleted). A backup is saved first, and Apple's driver comes back automatically if the device doesn't start. Windows will ask for administrator permission. Unplug and reconnect the cable afterwards."
msgstr "与直播伴侣 (TikTok LIVE Studio) 类似，ZenLink 会为此设备安装 libusb-win32 驱动。安装期间，Apple 模式及 Apple 官方应用将无法识别该设备；如需切回，点击“恢复 Apple 驱动”即可。若尚无此型号的驱动包，ZenLink 将自动构建并使用名为“ZenLink ZenLink Studio”的新证书签名，同时将其添加至 Windows 受信任证书（其私钥随后会被删除）。操作前会先保存备份，若设备未能正常启动将自动回滚至 Apple 驱动。Windows 随后会请求管理员权限。完成后请拔下并重新连接数据线。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1270
msgid "Remove the libusb0 filter?"
msgstr "确定移除 libusb0 过滤器？"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1271
msgid "It is stacked on Apple's driver, which can crash Windows. Apple's driver stays. A backup is saved first. Windows will ask for administrator permission."
msgstr "该过滤器叠加在 Apple 驱动上，可能导致 Windows 崩溃。移除后 Apple 驱动仍会保留。操作前会先保存备份，Windows 随后会请求管理员权限。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1292
msgid "Changing the device's driver…"
msgstr "正在更改设备驱动程序…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1293
msgid "Approve the Windows permission prompt. A PowerShell window shows each step; keep the cable plugged in until it finishes."
msgstr "请批准 Windows 权限请求弹窗。PowerShell 窗口将显示执行步骤；在完成前请保持数据线连接。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1352
msgid "Driver changed"
msgstr "驱动已更改"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1355
msgid "The ZenLink service needs a restart to use {target} mode. Unplug the cable and plug it in again."
msgstr "ZenLink 服务需要重启才能使用 {target} 模式。请拔下数据线并重新插入。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1361
msgid "The backend did not answer."
msgstr "后台服务未响应。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1366
msgid "The previous state was restored."
msgstr "已恢复至先前的状态。"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1373
